","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321228009:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321228010:1":{"text":"……描かないと。","source_cn":"我……我想为它画张速写。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD306471F5041AC1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321228011:1":{"text":"それが僕からの惜別と……感謝の気持ちだ。","source_cn":"就当是……告别和谢礼吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5FC5E6C101E41CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321228012:1":{"text":"絵には花畑も一緒に描くよ……これでずっと見ていられるだろ？","source_cn":"它会一直在画里，在花海里……永远不化。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCDD3AE7A62728D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1321228013:1":{"text":"そして雪だるまの絵画をすばやく二枚描いた。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03220BB8A1265385","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:13